  "description": "Issue #303: MlElementEditor render-performance measurements, run on demand (runOnDemand: the vitest entry skips the suite unless MIROIR_COMPONENT_PERF=1; Miroir Tests runs it when launched). One leaf per single-type editor (string, number, bigint, boolean, date, uuid, enum, literal, array, tuple, record, object, union, any) and one leaf on the test pattern; each leaf is one measureRendering step (3 iterations, remount and update; update alternates the leaf's initialFormState and a different valid value). No timing budget: the step fails only if rendering fails or nothing is measured. Props are copied from the #292 per-editor instances, the date leaf from the test pattern's aDate; the any leaf uses display.any.format file so that MlAnyEditor is measured; the literal leaf updates to the same value (a literal has one valid value). DUPLICATION: the test pattern leaf's rawMlSchema and initialFormState are a copy of the componentProps of MlTestPattern_ComponentTestSuite (26ef2886-2cd8-4f91-b846-1525b24d5f41); change both together. Edited by hand.",
